{
  "about": "Cross-language test vectors for the crosstalk bridge (docs/bridge.md). Generated once from bridge/plugin.py 0.1.0 and frozen: bridge/tests/test_plugin.py and crates/crosstalk-core/src/bridge.rs both check this file, so a change to canonical JSON or signing in either language fails a test. Each \"json\" and \"envelope\" is raw JSON text so both sides parse the same bytes.",
